From 1bf35a3f1c74dc61fdd236eaef20462b5678a7a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hermes <hermes@local>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 04:29:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 04/12] tp: distributed rank transport + TP3/TP4 plans for
 multi-Spark

Add TCP framed control-plane adapter, one-rank-per-process collective
API (host mock + NCCL InitRank), validate world=3 AllExpertsFfnWidth and
world=4 ExpertFfn2D, and CPU tests for protocol dry-run + sockets.

Not yet a full-model multi-Spark generator: rank-local GGUF load and
eager K3 forward remain the next milestones.
